B.Ln=A.a(s(["Lantern Town keeps its lamps lit for travellers like you. UEC patrols rarely bother us here.","The job board posts woods and city errands \u2014 nests, caches, moonflowers. Come back to turn them in.","I trade glimmer for gear. Portal south when you're ready. Check the board if you have time."]),t.s)
