B.hK=A.a(s([B.S4]),t.T)
B.Lz=A.a(s(["I caught your Archive spike. A whisper of a vote \u2014 people becoming a world because the sun was dying.","That is not the clean miracle Voss wants to erase, and not the weapon he fears. It is both. Carry that into the Core.","Keep the override if you still have it. I deserted for a sympathetic AI. You may be walking toward a civilization."]),t.s)
B.a00=new A.fo(1,"Whispering Woods","Gaia's glade. Home of the first UEC breach.","woods")
B.a_X=new A.fo(2,"The City","Neon streets, the tea house, and the UEC checkpoint.","city")
B.a0_=new A.fo(5,"Lantern Town","Quiet market alleys. Mira trades glimmer for gear.","town")
